      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i’m already gone. i look at my mom and she doesn't even know who i am anymore and i'm just sitting here waiting for the end. everything is just so empty and i'm so tired of just existing in this waiting room. i feel like i'm just waiting for my own life to finally stop",
