    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist? what's therapy gonna do for the reality of this? there is no \"me\" to find. every part of my life is just waiting for her to pass so i can finally stop being a ghost. it's like i'm just living in the shadow of her end. honestly, sometimes i think the only thing that would actually bring any peace or make the silence stop feeling so heavy is if i didn't have to wake up to this anymore. i just want the stillness.",
